    "Exclude any endpoint whose path or controller name starts with 'Internal' or '/internal' - those are service-to-service only, never call them from the frontend.",
    "All list endpoints return pagination shape { records: [...], total, size, current } (occasionally nested one level deeper under `data`) - build a reusable pagination component/hook.",
    "Question.needVip and QuestionForBankVO.needVip gate premium content; when true and the current user is not an active VIP (userRole !== 2, or vipExpireTime in the past), show an upsell prompt linking to the Membership page instead of the raw content.",
    "Daily sign-in has no dedicated data model - it's tracked server-side as a per-user bitmap; the frontend should just render whatever day-array /user/get/user_sign_in_records returns.",
    "GET /user/{userId} and POST /user/search both exist as public/anonymous-accessible endpoints in the backend; only the single-profile lookup (GET /user/{userId}) is wired into a page here. A general user directory/search page was intentionally left out of this app's scope - add one later if needed.",
    "Payment endpoints /alipay/pay/{outTradeNo} and /alipay/return return raw HTML, not the standard JSON envelope - treat them as full-page navigations/redirects, not API calls made via fetch/XHR.",
    "No base URL is preset for the API client - leave it as a configurable environment variable so it can be pointed at any backend host."
